        "content": "<p>dishmaker opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14078\">PR #14078</a> from <code>dishmaker:dishmaker/perf_opt_print_rawinst_display</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This decreases <code>cargo llvm-lines</code> from <code>1698144</code> to <code>1687711</code>.</p>\n<p>Change: <code>-0.61%</code></p>\n<p>Should decrease compile times too.</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">cargo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">llvm</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">lines</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">p</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cranelift</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">codegen</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">F</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">anyhow</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">capstone</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">disas</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">enable</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">serde</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">gimli</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">host</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">arch</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">incremental</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">cache</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">postcard</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">pulley</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">serde</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">serde_derive</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">sha2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">timing</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"n\">unwind</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"codehilite\"